# M151 SDK header manifest.
# ------------------------
# 40 of the M120 entries no longer exist. 22 moved and are repointed in place:
# ui/gfx/native_widget_types.h became ui/gfx/native_ui_types.h, and Skia
# reorganised (include/private/base -> include/private, include/gpu ->
# include/gpu/ganesh, src/base -> src/core). The other 18 were deleted upstream
# with no successor to install - base/ranges (now std::ranges), base/strings
# string_piece (now std::string_view), base/containers/contains.h,
# base/template_util.h, ui/gfx's *_export.h (now COMPONENT_EXPORT), Skia's
# SkDrawLooper.h and GrGLConfig_chrome.h - so they are dropped.
#
# NOTE: this is the CBE SDK's public header set. Anything outside this tree that
# still includes a dropped header (WAM is the obvious candidate) needs the same
# migration upstream made; it will fail to compile against this SDK until then.
